			},
			"date": "2022-11-11T14:53:25.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I had exactly the same thoughts. For me it's a lot about my negativity bias. I find myself surprised here by all the positive conversations. I obviously now have this built-in suspicion that the next asshole lurks behind the next reply. I really don't want to assume this per default. I feel quite a bit manipulated there.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
