			},
			"date": "2022-11-11T15:01:58.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> the algorithms never helped do anything but encourage negative behaviors. I wanted to learn more about building software but usually ended up seeing the most controversial posts. I prefer this way. I’d rather scroll through hundreds of toots than have rage pushed to the top of my feeds</p>",
