			},
			"date": "2022-11-11T15:06:16.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> 💯 it's actually very comparable. There's a certain FOMO at the beginning but it starts to vanish and then it's just glorious.</p>",
