			"date": "2022-11-11T15:53:02.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Fortunately there were always also positive voices that focused on a good and uplifting things in life. Such as you. Your solid focus on helping others have made many a lot happier, in many ways. And you do it because you like helping people. And that is also why people like you a lot.</p>",
