			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I definitely think that the resistant to move over here are the ones that are deeply addicted to that type controversy and negativity, which caters to the most basic and ugly instincts of the human beings! Being negative is much much easier that being positive and to bring constructive arguments to the table!</p>",
